    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778280/extras/40f8bfa18c5e786d5c2257071fcbf863.poster.avif?t=1737527965\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778280/extras/40f8bfa18c5e786d5c2257071fcbf863.webm?t=1737527965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778280/extras/40f8bfa18c5e786d5c2257071fcbf863.mp4?t=1737527965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The player takes on the role of Kyosuke, who took his fianc\u00e9e, Erisa, to visit a lonely island in the sea. They attended a mysterious festival of the island's god, but the island seemed to be dormant with a great fear from the abyss\u2026in an endless nightmare, the cute fianc\u00e9e Erisa was abused and assaulted by others \u2013 and unspeakable things \u2013 at their will, with hardly any clothes on.<br><br>\u201cNo matter how many times I have to do it, I will save you!\u201d<br><br>I believed that I would be with her all my life.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778280/extras/807873e13c1e52eb43b07472946c0eaf.avif?t=1737527965\" /></div><br><br>That was why I would never give up so easily.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778280/extras/a8dbca4cbec4d2b0ff7520fc2dafb114.avif?t=1737527965\" /></div><br><br>And in an endless loop, I met a mysterious purple-haired girl. What secrets did this girl and this desert island hold?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778280/extras/1d535651c57ccd554b3c366359ed57c5.avif?t=1737527965\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Game Features</h2><br>\u25c7 24 basic CGs, including more than 300 differentials<br>\u25c7 Game text: 100,000<br>\u25c7 Two main female characters and three secondary female characters<br>\u25c7 A Cthulhu-style game with an infinite flow storyline<br>\u25c7 Contains group sex, tentacles, and grotesque scenes<br>\u25c7 Game endings: 2 types<strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Featured Systems</h2><br>\u25c7Full CG mode can be turned on in the environment setting, and HCG can be freely browsed.<br>\u25c7Pressure-Free Operation Support one-click mouse operation-Fast text-to-text system",
